<title>BERMUDA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 81-4, CHASING 326 TO BEAT NZ.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 81-4, CHASING 326 TO BEAT NZ.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, New Zealand 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chasing 326 to win, Sri Lanka were 81 for four at lunch on Monday on the fourth day of the second cricket test against New Zealand.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 222, second innings 273 (B.Young 62, S.Fleming 59, N. Zoysa 3-53).</p>
<p>Sri Lanka first innings 170, second innings 81 for four.</p>
